        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.12.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Isham 12:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basuula mafunde yonse ayakwa Yawe Lesa wabo, elyo baipangila ifilubi fibili ifyalengwa mu cipasho ca fiponti fya ŋombe elyo no luceshi lwa mulungu Asher. Balapepa ne fita fyonse fya mu mulu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17:16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "ifita fya mu mulu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ekutila intanda, akasuba, umweshi na fyonse ifyaba mu mulu pamo ne milungu ne fimipashi ifyo balepepa.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " no kushinshimuna umulungu Baali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.18.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amaf 18:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17:17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Babaibele bamo batila balapeela amalambo abana babo abaume na banakashi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balapisha abana babo abaume na banakashi mu mulilo. Balabuka no kupanda ubwanga elyo no kuiposaika mukubifya pa cinso cakwa Yawe, bamulenga no kukalipa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi Yawe epakufulilwa abena Israeli apakalamba, abafumya na ku cinso cakwe. Uluko lwa bena Yuda elwashelefye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo na bena Yuda bene balifililwe ukubaka amafunde yakwa Yawe Lesa wabo. Balakonkelela imisango iyo abena Israeli batendeke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ecalengele Yawe akaane umutundu wa bena Israeli onse, abacusha no kubapeela mu minwe ya bantalamisoka mpaka abafumya pa cinso cakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo apatula abena Israeli ukufuma ku ŋanda yakwa Davidi, bena babuulile Yeroboamu mwana Nebati bamucita imfumu. Yeroboamu ena epakutunka abena Israeli ukufuma kukukonka Yawe no kubalenga ukuti babifye nganshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abena Israeli batwalililafye mu fyabubifi fyonse ifyo Yeroboamu acitile icakuti bafilwa no kulekako, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mpakafye Yawe afika na pakubafumya pa cinso cakwe, nga filya fine asokele ukupitila mu babomfi bakwe bonse bakasesema. Eico abena Israeli babafumishe mu calo cabo no kuya muli bunkole mu calo ca Asiria, eko baikala ukushinta ne lelo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imfumu ya ku Asiria yaleta abantu ukufuma ku Babiloni, ku Kuta, ku Afa, ku Hamati na ku Sefafaimu no kubateka mu mishi iya mu Samaria ukupyana abena Israeli, basuka bapokolola Samaria baikala na mu mishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo batampile ukwikala mulya mwine tabalepepa Yawe, eco atumine inkalamo pakati kabo nasho shaipayapo abantu bamo bamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo baeba imfumu ya ku Asiria ukuti, “Abantu watwele nokuya bateka mu mishi ya mu Samaria tabaishiba ifyo umulungu wa muli cilya calo ufwaya. Nautuma inkalamo pakati kabo ishambile ukubepaya, pantu abantu tabaishiba ifyo umulungu wa muli cilya calo ufwaya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo imfumu ya ku Asiria yapeela icebo ukuti, “Buulenipo shimapepo umo pali balya mwasendele bunkole ukufuma ku Samaria abwelelemo mukuya ikala kulya elyo akaye funda abantu ifyo umulungu wa muli cilya calo wafwaya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi umo shimapepo uwafumine ku Samaria muli bunkole aisa mukwikala mu Betele, alabafunda ifyakupepa Yawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo cila mushobo waicitila imilungu wauko mu misumba baikelemo no kuubika mu mayanda yakupepelamo ayo abantu ba mu Samaria bakuulile mu ncende ishasansama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaume ba ku Babiloni bapanga umulungu wa Sukoti Benoti, abaume ba ku Kuta bapanga uwa Negali, elyo na baume ba ku Hamati bapanga uwa Ashima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abena Afi bapanga umulungu wa Nibihasi na Tataki, elyo abena Sefafaimu bena balaoca abana babo mu mulilo nga malambo kuli Adarameleki na Anameleki, imilungu ya bena Sefafaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balapepa Yawe, nomba basonta abantu babo icisontesonte abakulabomba nga bashimapepo mu mayanda yakupepelamo pa ncende isho bacindika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo ilyo bayambile ukupepa Yawe, nomba mu misango imbi balebombela imilungu yabo ukulingana ne ntambi sha mishobo iyo babafumishemo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
